# ── Runtime sensor state (regenerated by iot/sensor_sim.py) ───────────
# The virtual ESP32 writes readings into a local SQLite DB. It is live
# device state, not a project input — regenerate it, never commit it.
data/field.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ── DELIBERATELY TRACKED ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/raw/         real NASA POWER, Open-Meteo and SoilGrids downloads.
#                   Committed so the pipeline is reproducible without
#                   re-hitting the APIs (and so the exact bytes behind
#                   every published number are pinned).
# data/processed/   simulator output + engineered features. Deterministic
#                   and seeded, but committed so results can be checked
#                   without a 3-minute rebuild.
# outputs/          metrics, figures and the 9 trained XGBoost models.
#                   These are the evidence behind the report. Keep them.
